  { "id": "sec-graph", "front": "(HL) Key features of $y = \\sec x$?", "back": "Vertical asymptotes where $\\cos x = 0$ ($x = \\frac\\pi2 + k\\pi$); range $y \\le -1$ or $y \\ge 1$; period $2\\pi$; even.", "concept": "Reciprocal ratios", "kind": "graph" },
  { "id": "cot-graph", "front": "(HL) Asymptotes of $y = \\csc x$ and $y = \\cot x$?", "back": "Where $\\sin x = 0$: $x = k\\pi$. $\\cot x$ has zeros at $x = \\frac\\pi2 + k\\pi$, period $\\pi$.", "concept": "Reciprocal ratios", "kind": "graph" },
